<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-628] JDBC Interpreter mangles SQL</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-628</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Reproducer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;%jdbc
select max(ss_promo_sk), ss_customer_sk from qhive.tpcds_orc_500.store_sales where ss_sold_date_sk &amp;gt;= 2452640 and ss_customer_sk &amp;gt; 3 and ss_customer_sk &amp;lt; 20 group by ss_customer_sk
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Actually runs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;_promo_sk), ss_customer_sk from qhive.tpcds_orc_500.store_sales where ss_sold_date_sk &amp;gt;= 2452640 and ss_customer_sk &amp;gt; 3 and ss_customer_sk &amp;lt; 20 group by ss_customer_sk&apos;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It looks like it is trying to find a property key which is a feature I do not understand.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Logs:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt; INFO [2016-01-22 19:16:02,306] ({pool-2-thread-3} JDBCInterpreter.java[interpret]:344) - Run SQL command &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;select max(ss_promo_sk), ss_customer_sk from qhive.tpcds_orc_500.store_sales where ss_sold_date_sk &amp;gt;= 2452640 and ss_customer_sk &amp;gt; 3 and ss_customer_sk &amp;lt; 20 group by ss_customer_sk&apos;&lt;/span&gt;
 INFO [2016-01-22 19:16:02,307] ({pool-2-thread-3} JDBCInterpreter.java[interpret]:355) - PropertyKey: ss_promo_sk, SQL command: &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;_promo_sk), ss_customer_sk from qhive.tpcds_orc_500.store_sales where ss_sold_date_sk &amp;gt;= 2452640 and ss_customer_sk &amp;gt; 3 and ss_customer_sk &amp;lt; 20 group by ss_customer_sk&apos;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The workaround is to run:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;default&lt;/span&gt;) select max(ss_promo_sk), ss_customer_sk from qhive.tpcds_orc_500.store_sales where ss_sold_date_sk &amp;gt;= 2452640 and ss_customer_sk &amp;gt; 3 and ss_customer_sk &amp;lt; 20 group by ss_customer_sk
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you can explain why a propertyKey is required, I can try to provide a patch. I do not understand the intention behind propertyKeys.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
